<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">7</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．申报考评工种技师证书（如系车改转岗，同时上传原岗位工种技师证书）；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">8</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．量化评价表及量化评价相关证明材料（须与量化评价表加分项一致）；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">9</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．在公开发行的报刊上发表的与本工种（专业）相关的论文至少</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">1</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">篇（封面页、目录页、发表的论文页）；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">10</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．申报汽车驾驶与管理工种须提供</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt">B</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">证以上机动车驾驶执照；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">11</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．申报汽车驾驶与管理工种需提供车队调度管理工作证明及近</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">5</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年无重大交通事故证明（交警部门或单位主管部门出具）；</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt">&ensp; </span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">12</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．申报收银审核工种须所在单位出具财务管理工作经历的证明；</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">13</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．上岗证（申报需持证上岗的工种，须提供有效期内的上岗证书，如电工、锅炉操作等）；</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt"> </span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">14</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．破格申报材料（破格申报人员须书面提出申请，并提供由单位或有关部门出具的符合破格申报条件的相关证明材料）。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:黑体">四、其他事项</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">1</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．等级工、技师和高级技师的申报资格条件按照《江苏省机关事业单位工勤技能岗位技术等级考评实施意见》（苏人社发</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">2024</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">〕</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">44</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">号）有关要求执行。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">2</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．机关事业单位非在编工勤人员申报资格条件、申报方式及相关要求参照在编工勤人员。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">3</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．各申报单位人事部门登陆江苏省人力资源和社会保障厅网上办事服务大厅（网址：</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">https://rs.jshrss.jiangsu.gov.cn/index/</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">），按要求填报申报人员相关信息，并将申报所需材料扫描上传。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">4</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．申报中级工对工作年限和本等级工作年限的要求：工作年限</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">10</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年（</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">2017</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年底前参加工作），并在</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">2021</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年底前取得初级工证书。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">5</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．申报高级工对工作年限和本等级工作年限的要求：工作年限</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">20</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年（</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">2007</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年底前参加工作），并在</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">2021</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年底前取得中级工证书。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">6</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．申报技师对本等级工作年限和学历的要求：取得高级工证书人员本等级工作年限达</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">5</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年可申报技师，今年对应的时间是</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt">2022</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年底前取得高级工证书的人员；要具备高级技工学校、</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">技师学院及中等以上专业技术学校本工种（专业）毕业证书或大专以上学历、人力资源和社会保障部门颁发的成人高等教育专业证书。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">7</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．申报高级技师对本等级工作年限和学历的要求：取得技师证书人员本等级工作年限达</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">5</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年可申报高级技师，今年对应的是</span><span style="font-size:
16.0pt">2022</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年底前取得技师证书的人员；要具备大专以上学历或取得人力资源和社会保障部门颁发的成人高等教育专业证书。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">8</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．转岗人员的等级年限，从转岗前取得原工种岗位等级证书的时间起算。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">9</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．已转岗人员，要按新工种申报，不能按转岗前工种申报上一个等级。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">10</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．往年等级工考核不合格人员，技师、高级技师综合评审未通过或参加培训后因特殊情况申请延期考核人员，须重新通过网上申报并按要求上传相关材料，申报材料待各级工考部门审核通过后，届时培训单位会通知学员参加培训考核。往年综合评审未通过，重新申报技师考评的人员，今年不需要参加选拔考试。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">11</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．申报技师和高级技师人员的继续教育培训不作为申报的必备条件，列为量化评价加分项。申报等级工人员的继续教育培训按原规定执行，须提供</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">2021</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年至</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">2025</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">年的继续教育培训合格证书。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">12</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．申报技师和高级技师人员量化评价中的日常表现、表彰类荣誉、技能类荣誉、继续教育培训评价得分，须经单位人事部门审核、并按要求进行不少于</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt">5</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">天的公示。</span></p>
<p style="margin:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;font-size:10.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;text-indent:32.0pt;line-height:29.0pt"><span style="font-size:16.0pt">13</span><span style="font-size:16.0pt;
font-family:仿宋,仿宋_GB2312">．各等级网上申报时，要预留因材料不符合要求被退回后的修改和补充材料时间，避免申报材料被退回后，由于申报日期截止，而无法再次上传申报材料。报名时间截止后，申报系统将关闭，不予补报。</span></p>
